---

<Layout
  title="Flats Near Marunji Hinjewadi | Mahindra Rivenza Luxury Homes ₹90L*"
  description="Searching for flats near Marunji / Hinjewadi Phase 2? Discover Mahindra Rivenza in Baner Annex / Mahalunge. 13.46 acres with ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouse from ₹90L*."
  keywords="flats near marunji, flats in marunji hinjewadi, 2 bhk flats in marunji, 3 bhk flats in marunji, mahindra rivenza mahalunge pune"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/flats-near-marunji/"
  customSchema={marunjiSchema}
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">
        <span>Prime Alternative to Hinjewadi Phase 2 Congestion</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        Flats Near Marunji: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Upgrade to Planned Township Luxury</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Avoid narrow village corridors and unorganized infrastructure in Marunji. Mahindra Rivenza in Baner Annex offers PMRDA 36m DP roads, 9+ acres of biophilic greenery, and rapid 7-min Hinjewadi Phase 1 access starting from ₹90 Lakhs*.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
        <button
          data-open-modal
          data-interest="Marunji Buyer Priority"
          class="btn-shimmer px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-300 via-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase hover:shadow-xl transition-all cursor-pointer"
        >
          Download Master Plan &amp; Cost Sheet
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ResidenceSelector />
</Layout>
